      <div type="clause" n="83">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Abt">Abt</ref> 83</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hio oþrum mæn in sceat bewyddod sy, XX scillinga gebete.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If she should be betrothed to another man by goods [i.e., the bride-price has been paid], let him pay 20 shillings [to that man as well].</ab>
